fferent box design. The physical package may appear with five neatly labeled cluster folders (labels unreadable) and printed SOP pages in one uniform layout, and a laptop showing the package's Excel SOP compliance dashboard (bar charts and a donut chart). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Small puskesmas quality office in the late morning: a metal archive shelf with mixed folders, a whiteboard with colored marker lines (no readable text), a desk with a laptop, a stamp pad and a stack of loose SOP printouts, window daylight. No other people. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · top-down close-up: three SOP folders with visibly different page layouts side by side (no readable text); cut to medium shot as he looks to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "SOP kami masih comot sana-sini." Delivery (EN): dry, honest 2–4s Problem · medium shot, he lifts pages from two folders to compare them. VO (ID, verbatim): "Formatnya beda tiap klaster." Delivery (EN): concerned 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, he runs a finger down a page header. VO (ID, verbatim): "Kode dokumennya juga tidak urut." Delivery (EN): frustrated but calm 6–8s Problem · slow push-in, he looks at the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Surveior pasti tanya daftar induknya." Delivery (EN): firm 8–10s Beat · medium shot, he stacks the three folders aside and exhales. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet office room tone, a ceiling fan, papers being laid down. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, generated text overlays, watermark, poster layout, storyboard panels, or added graphics. Do not invent product details, claims, prices, ratings, testimonials, certifications, or guarantees. Keep exact talent face, the WARDROBE above, product shape, colors, packaging, box cover, cluster folders, laptop screen content, and visual details consistent with the DNA references.